/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1048 0 R
/E (The goal of this project is to design a low-power Power Management Unit \(PMU\) for a battery-powered biomedical sensor interface.The PMU supplies the power and reference signals required by the sensing system while operating from a small battery that must support a long operating lifetime. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [42]
>>
endobj
109 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1049 0 R
/E (The design must therefore achieve a good compromise between power consumption, accuracy, noise, PSRR, regulation, startup behavior, and robustness.The PMU will interface with an Analog Front End \(AFE\) and a 14-bit ADC.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [43]
>>
endobj
